{"id":"B2-L042","title":"Third Conditional — production and review","cefr":"B2","level":"B2","unit":"B2-U03","focus":"Third Conditional — produção e revisão","targets":{"grammar":"Third Conditional — produção e revisão","pron":"Flap T americano","verbs":[],"pv":[],"expr":[],"words":["order delay","supplier failure","stock check","customer apology","client complaint","compensation offer","warehouse stock","reply letter","formal apology","business email","supplier contract","rush order","service failure","quality control","promise date","loyal client","email signature","order tracking","late apology","stock error"],"field":"Economia básica","genre":"E-mail, carta, mensagem","skill":"Escuta","words_min":20},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 42 · Third Conditional — production and review","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Third Conditional — produção e revisão.","**Pronúncia:** Flap T americano.","**20 palavras novas** (economia básica).","**Texto do dia:** e-mail, carta, mensagem."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (B2):** eu consigo escrever um e-mail com Third Conditional pedindo desculpas e explicando causas."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["","Esta aula treina **ouvir e anotar informações (IELTS Listening, TOEFL Listening)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["order delay","atraso de pedido"],["supplier failure","falha do fornecedor"],["stock check","verificação de estoque"],["customer apology","pedido de desculpas ao cliente"],["client complaint","reclamação de cliente"],["compensation offer","oferta de compensação"],["warehouse stock","estoque do armazém"],["reply letter","carta de resposta"],["formal apology","desculpas formais"],["business email","e-mail comercial"],["supplier contract","contrato com fornecedor"],["rush order","pedido urgente"],["service failure","falha de serviço"],["quality control","controle de qualidade"],["promise date","data prometida"],["loyal client","cliente fiel"],["email signature","assinatura de e-mail"],["order tracking","rastreio de pedido"],["late apology","desculpa tardia"],["stock error","erro de estoque"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · An e-mail","blocks":[{"type":"mail","from":"ana@mail.com","to":"client@firm.com","subject":"Apologies for the delay","paras":["Dear Mr. Lopes,","I’m very sorry for the delay. If the supplier **had delivered** on time, we **would have shipped** your order last week. If I **had checked** the stock earlier, I **wouldn’t have promised** a date I couldn’t keep.","**Had I known**, I **would have warned** you. We will compensate you.","Sincerely, Ana"],"gloss":[["supplier","fornecedor"],["stock","estoque"],["compensate","compensar"],["warn","avisar"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"The supplier delivered on time.","ans":"F","why":"had delivered (didn’t)."},{"q":"Ana would have warned the client if she had known.","ans":"T","why":"would have warned."},{"q":"Ana will compensate the client.","ans":"T","why":"compensate you."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“supplier” = ?","opts":["fornecedor","suporte","superior"],"ans":0,"why":"supplier."},{"q":"“compensate” = ?","opts":["compensar","competir","comprar"],"ans":0,"why":"compensate."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Third Conditional em desculpas","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Estrutura","Exemplo"],"rows":[["if + had + part.","**If the supplier had delivered,…**"],["would have + part.","**…we would have shipped.**"],["inversão formal","**Had I known, I would have warned you.**"],["compensação","**We will compensate you.**"]],"cap":"Third Conditional em desculpas"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"**Inversão formal**: *Had I known…* = *If I 